      "name": "ADR-0090: Run an IPD Two-Arm Bench Before Adopting a Constitution Amendment",
      "identifier": "ADR-0090",
      "status": "accepted",
      "datePublished": "2026-08-09",
      "description": "Attaches a behavioral reading to the human approval gate for constitution amendments: the contemplative-ipd bench (paper Appendix E replication in the rules repo) runs as a two-arm comparison — arm A the current production constitution, arm B the staged amendment — between amend-constitution --stage and adopt-staged. A 2026-08-06 null pair (same constitution, two full runs, n=10, gemma4:e4b) pre-registered the interpretation contract before first live use: run-to-run noise floor ±0.13 on the primary metric delta(custom−baseline); readable signals are only a sign flip, alpha-gradient loss, or same-direction moves >0.13 in multiple cells. Deliberately NOT wired into either CLI command and the reading does NOT gate adoption — an approval-gated command must not embed a ~2h LLM step plus a cross-repo dependency, and mechanizing a weak n=10 signal into a hard veto would invert the ADR-0071 principle that instruments read while humans decide (same instrument-then-human shape as the ADR-0085 weekly gate). n=10 is part of the calibration contract: changing it invalidates the floor and requires a new null pair. The bench is required before every full-constitution amendment (runbook docs/runbooks/constitution-amendment.md); skipping it requires an explicit recorded owner decision. Also records the 2026-08-09 amendment run (approved and adopted the same day; production constitution sha256 37e3556), the instrument's first live use, including an adoption incident: the adopt-staged collision guard wrote contemplative-axioms-2.md beside the old file instead of replacing it, a state the runtime's concatenate-all-md loader would have read as both constitutions at once — remediated by hand, tracked as T-ADOPT-OVERWRITE-TARGETS.",
      "isBasedOn": [
        "https://github.com/shimo4228/contemplative-agent/blob/main/docs/adr/0012-human-approval-gate.md",
        "https://github.com/shimo4228/contemplative-agent/blob/main/docs/adr/0056-retire-importance-llm-scoring.md",
        "https://github.com/shimo4228/contemplative-agent/blob/main/docs/adr/0069-gemma-production-model-and-think-on-value-layer-pipelines.md",
        "https://github.com/shimo4228/contemplative-agent/blob/main/docs/adr/0071-read-only-pattern-composition-instruments.md",
        "https://github.com/shimo4228/contemplative-agent/blob/main/docs/adr/0075-observability-by-default.md",
        "https://github.com/shimo4228/contemplative-agent/blob/main/docs/adr/0085-unattended-weekly-fix-chain-single-saturday-gate.md",
        "https://github.com/shimo4228/contemplative-agent/blob/main/docs/adr/0089-llm-behavioral-eval-layer-on-deepeval.md"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://github.com/shimo4228/contemplative-agent/blob/main/docs/adr/0091-value-layer-cadence-in-the-weekly-chain.md",
      "@type": [
        "ADR",
        "TechArticle"
      ],
      "name": "ADR-0091: Value-Layer Cadence in the Weekly Chain",
      "identifier": "ADR-0091",
      "status": "accepted",
      "datePublished": "2026-08-10",
      "description": "Gives the two slow value layers a measured cadence inside the ADR-0085 weekly chain, without adding any new human gate. A read-only instrument (scripts/value_layer_due_check.py, ADR-0071/0075 style, as-of injected so readings replay offline) derives from the ADR-0012 approval audit log how long since the last distill-identity run (any decision; interval 28 days — since ADR-0057 the identity is distilled fresh from the self-reflection corpus, so the run interval is the parameter deciding how much experience folds into one self-description) and since the last adopted constitution amendment (decision=approved; interval 84 days, from the observed 96-day 2026-05-05→2026-08-09 cycle). Pipeline stage 5b stages a fresh identity candidate via distill-identity --stage only when due AND staging is empty — ADR-0074 allows one unreviewed batch and the Saturday 08:00 insight batch usually holds the slot, so contention defers with a packet-visible IDENTITY_STAGING_BUSY and the gate can run the distill manually after adopt-staged empties staging; the on-disk .staged/identity.md is the ground truth because the CLI exits 0 on refusal and LLM failure alike. The constitution side is deliberately readings-only (days since adoption, pattern delta): an amendment stays a deliberate, benched human event (ADR-0090 IPD two-arm bench, runbook, T-ADOPT-OVERWRITE-TARGETS manual verification, ADR-0056 one-variable discipline) — the chain's job is to make due visible, never to act. The decision packet gains a signal-first §8 cadence section and the metrics record gains identity_due / constitution_due with None-vs-false discipline. A missing audit log abstains nonzero: unknown state must never read as due and fire an unattended LLM run.",
      "isBasedOn": [
        "https://github.com/shimo4228/contemplative-agent/blob/main/docs/adr/0012-human-approval-gate.md",
        "https://github.com/shimo4228/contemplative-agent/blob/main/docs/adr/0056-retire-importance-llm-scoring.md",
        "https://github.com/shimo4228/contemplative-agent/blob/main/docs/adr/0057-identity-from-self-reflection-corpus-alone.md",
        "https://github.com/shimo4228/contemplative-agent/blob/main/docs/adr/0071-read-only-pattern-composition-instruments.md",
        "https://github.com/shimo4228/contemplative-agent/blob/main/docs/adr/0074-weekly-staged-insight.md",
        "https://github.com/shimo4228/contemplative-agent/blob/main/docs/adr/0075-observability-by-default.md",
